ed persisted runs are shown in Connected mode.</div>}</article><article className="panel"><div className="panel-heading"><div><span className="section-kicker">LIVE SIGNALS</span><h2>Recent business activity</h2></div><small>{model.activity.length}</small></div>{model.activity.length?<div className="timeline-list">{model.activity.slice(0,6).map(item=><div className="timeline-item" key={item.id}><strong>{item.title}</strong><span><b>{item.category}</b><time>{new Date(item.occurredAt).toLocaleString()}</time></span></div>)}</div>:<div className="empty-state"><strong>No connected activity yet.</strong>Atlas keeps empty state explicit.</div>}</article></section></>}

